msgid "This game relies on the save file you initially create. Please do not remove the Memory<I=BL>Stick<I=TM> or change it for another Memory<I=BL>Stick<I=TM> during gameplay as this may cause your save file to become disrupted."
msgstr "本游戏依赖初次创建的存档。游玩中请勿拔出存储<I=BL>卡<I=TM>或更换其他存储<I=BL>卡<I=TM>，否则可能导致存档损坏。"

#: slot/0x005caf77/0x8b79b6/0x3b222d
msgid ""
"This game saves data automatically\r\n"
"at certain points. Do not remove\r\n"
"the Memory<I=BL>Stick<I=TM> or switch off\r\n"
"the PSP<I=TM> system when \n"
"the Memory<I=BL>Stick<I=TM> access \n"
"indicator is flashing."
msgstr ""
"本游戏会在某些时间点自动保存数据。\r\n"
"请勿在Memory<I=BL>Stick<I=TM>的\r\n"
"存取指示灯闪烁时取出\r\n"
"Memory<I=BL>Stick<I=TM>或关闭\r\n"
"PSP<I=TM>主机电源。\r\n"
"存取指示灯闪烁时。"

#: slot/0x005caf77/0x8b79b6/0x437cf5
