"Insufficient free space on\r\n"
"the Memory<I=BL>Stick<I=TM>. This game requires \r\n"
"at least XXMB of free space in order \r\n"
"to save data. This game cannot be played \r\n"
"without a Memory<I=BL>Stick<I=TM>. Delete data \n"
"to \rcreate additional free space, or insert \r\n"
"a Memory<I=BL>Stick<I=TM> with at least XXMB\r\n"
"of free space."
msgstr ""
"存储<I=BL>卡<I=TM>的剩余空间\r\n"
"不足。本游戏保存数据至少需要\r\n"
"XXMB 的剩余空间。没有\r\n"
"存储<I=BL>卡<I=TM>将无法游玩本游戏。\r\n"
"请删除数据以\r\n"
"腾出空间，或插入\r\n"
"一张至少有 XXMB\r\n"
"剩余空间的存储<I=BL>卡<I=TM>。"

