#: slot/0x005caf77/0x8b79b6/0xaa0c5c
msgid ""
"This game uses a Data Installation feature.\n"
"Removing the Memory<I=BL>Stick<I=TM> or entering Sleep Mode during gameplay will temporarily disable access to installed game data.\n"
"\n"
"* Data Installation speeds up load times and enables audio for CODEC calls during gameplay.\n"
"\n"
"If the Data Installation feature is disabled, it can be  restored by returning to the Mission Select screen."
msgstr ""
"本游戏使用数据安装功能。\n"
"游玩中拔出存储<I=BL>卡<I=TM>或进入睡眠模式，将暂时无法访问已安装的游戏数据。\n"
"\n"
"* 数据安装可加快读取速度，并启用游玩中 CODEC 通话的语音。\n"
"\n"
"若数据安装功能被禁用，返回任务选择画面即可恢复。"

